{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_st02","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_st02","title":"倾泻腐朽的花","storyCode":"EP-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"8a0b24719d0f1fd4fc5ae9fd5d4f0818e1424e13eab298f22e97983dc3ab996d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"narration","text":"太阳落了下去，盐漠的晚上冷到所有人都在颤抖。\n大家翻遍了破落的船舱，才勉强找到了一些不知放了多久的鳞肉干和一口破锅。\n在仿生海龙的帮助下，锅中终于有了一点热气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太冷了......之前那些碎木头没撑多久，都已经烧完了，我让小叶先来代替一下火盆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是本来它的加热功能是用来暖手的，如果是烹煮食物的话，只能做到这种程度了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能吃到热的已经很伟大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物和淡水都不多，就算省着吃，这些也只能撑上两三天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是遇到雨云，把集雨用的布袋放出去，估计还能再收回来一点水......但盐漠里的天气向来难以预料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面喷发的那些蒸汽......不能当作水源吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里面混杂着盐漠深处的微生物，人不能直接喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以提纯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先修复罗盘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我们先熬过今晚再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盐漠深处的夜晚可不是闹着玩的，吃的本来就不够，有人还受了伤，不好好保暖的话，小心睡着睡着人就再也醒不过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的......真的会再也醒不过来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是现在再遇上盐鳞，我们可能真的就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我可以发挥特长，先给盐鳞传通讯，就说我们来了，让它们准备乖乖受死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我真不懂，你怎么不管什么时候都能这么没心没肺的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......忍忍吧，这个时候也就他会贫嘴了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"似乎是轧过了一条骸骨，征服宣告号颠簸了起来，破锅与里面的食物一同被震飞。\n极境一个激灵冲上前去接锅，却被烫得哀嚎。\n伊西多垫步上前，剑尖精准地穿过锅的把手，这才勉强保住晚餐。\n一旁，仿生海龙的热气也消散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加热功能......坏了，等我先修一下......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......嘶......好冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿嚏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以炼些简单的发热物质，应该不会花太久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些材料，用来修罗盘。取暖的事，我来想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿嚏！......阿嚏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐，能不能再分我一点毯子，我人小，冷得快，真的快要冻死了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候就别什么你的我的了，都挤到一块！伊西多，别在那边发愁了，过来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能和我这样的大帅哥挤在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！毯子盖住我的头了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g21_skystarry_L2"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜挡在风口，帕斯卡拉被蒂奇裹好，只露出一张被挤成一团的脸。\n极境和温蒂努力活动着僵硬的手指，好抓起食物送进嘴里。\n伊西多想要转身回到塑金台，但在拿起探针的那一刻，他意识到，自己冻僵的手指毫无用处。\n征服宣告号漫无目的地顺风行驶着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......我们现在要往哪里去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，往深处开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道我们要去哪里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道那些臭念经的什么时候追上来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道这么冷，我会不会就醒不过来了，或者是船又撞上什么东西......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她怎么突然这样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不该早早抢一个最暖和的位置睡下吗？说不定还会半夜抢我们所有人的毯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也就是个十岁刚出头的小丫头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她睡着了，还有点发烧，看看她的口袋里有没有什么能用的草药。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是明天我就要死在这里了......我还、我还想回我原先的家再睡一觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大房子还在......我的床、我的被子、我的浴缸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"穿最好看的衣服，一套又一套......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃不完的食物，花不完的钱，我不用再......被人一脚踢出去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被人踢好疼......从街这头滚到街那头，好疼......我只想回一趟家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要过上好日子......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不要死在......死在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到这次居然会走到这么危险的地步......抱歉，温蒂，我不该轻易地让你过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既然来了，就是来帮你们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能平安回到罗德岛，我把我这个月工资都赔给你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，啊哈......我先休息了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺？你还在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修罗盘，不然我们连骸礁峡谷都开不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船上颠簸太厉害，我需要搭建足够复杂的法术能量场来稳定心相原质，否则整个罗盘都很可能在我拆解它的那一刻分崩离析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使能够搭建出这样的能量场，我也需要确保自己施术的手足够稳，不会在进行物质重构的过程中出差错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果在心相原质内部刻印流体源石回路的过程中手有一丝颤抖，都可能废掉整块材料......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，极境，我也不确定明天我们是否能够......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看他那副样子，应该是累得厉害。今天他一直学着掌舵，之前没做过这种事情吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有，他之前只负责通讯相关的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也坐过来些吧，温度还在下降，挤一挤暖和一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠，你要不......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......夫人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......夫人......爸爸说你们出海......海真的是蓝色的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，你们能带我去出海吗？我觉得我长大了......我也能出海了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠？你这是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是小时候蒂奇在自己怀里听到的故事。\n胡安娜把手搭上蒂奇的额头，但现在她的额头已经爬上了皱纹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，蒂奇也发烧了，草药还有剩下的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找找......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"翻药声在船舱内响起，伴随着睡梦中的人们沉重的呼吸声。伊西多把锅架在勉强修好的仿生海龙上，准备烧水熬药。\n胡安娜看着船舱内部光秃秃的骨架，眼神柔和，像是想到很美妙的事。\n她把草药丢进锅，因为船的颠簸，锅子里发出了小小的，类似海浪的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，你见过海吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比天空还要湛蓝的海洋，翻着乳白色泡沫的波浪，仿佛能直接劈向我的云间闪电......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，要不要和我们一起出海？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会是个很好的船长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在昏暗中，胡安娜的双眼闪闪发光，骨架间，冰凉的星光透进来。\n他想要开口回答，但嘴张了张，最终还是沉默了下去。\n在他们逃来的方向，追兵的火光闪烁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帆布、鳞皮、大量的木材、黄金时代的遗物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但几乎完全没有食物和水。你们确实是走投无路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人总是这样，非要到这种境地，才能明白秩序的可贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对秩序的遵从为你们带来了食物、清水与居所。别忘了这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的人明白谈判是什么意思，他们会遵守定好的条款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，你会成为一个优秀的私掠头领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的引导下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把这些收缴来的物资清点入库，那些强盗也记录他们的姓名，然后带去城镇边缘那几间空置的房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上小心点，别引起太多镇民的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有他们设计的那艘能在盐漠上行进的船，要完好无损地运回来，那是镇子日后的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，西尔弗阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。还有什么要告诉我的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们事后还是去找了执裁官阁下......但只找到他衣物的残片。我给您放在桌上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后续的事务我会处理。你下去吧，让我独自安静一会儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安纳斯塔西奥，安纳斯塔西奥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为你能拯救我们所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你其实只在乎你自己，是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"破布上的黑灰沾脏了每天精心擦拭的桌面。西尔弗拎起破布，呆在原地。\n终于，他还是将那块破布扔进了壁炉，而后擦拭起那张办公桌。\n一如他每天清晨准时爬上钟塔，凝视着这座历经天灾与人祸，却仍屹立不倒的城镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不在乎这个国家，不在乎这座镇子，不在乎这些人。所以你不会明白，安纳斯塔西奥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚......不论繁华的商港还是贫瘠的渔村，那些侥幸没被海洋吞没的聚落，没有一座不在混乱中崩溃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的雅隆也是如此。是我把半生都投进了这里，是我把它从同类相食的惨剧和惨无人道的暴政中拯救了出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在也是我为它取得了能行走大地的盐船，要将它从贫瘠的废土中解放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，安纳斯塔西奥，你只看得见自己偏执而古板的信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你永远不属于雅隆，你也永远不会再干涉雅隆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的，雅隆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看看，通过复杂的传动结构，让风力驱动步足行走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来他们从最开始就没往陆行舰的方向去想。风力步行机......确实是天才般的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，那个阿戈尔女人，明明有如此才能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要造上三五艘，再加上从海盗那里缴获的，就能把雅隆的居民都搬上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几十年了......终于不用再被困在这片养不活任何人的盐漠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，哪里来的怪风。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这屋子漏风的吗，连火也点不着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几粒微小的火星从火柴头溅起，转瞬间又熄灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看见纤细的火苗在风中摇曳，忽明忽暗的光在黑暗中晕开。\n他的眼睛逐渐开始适应，周遭的事物一一在他的视野中浮现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i06_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后，他看见一张脸。盐一般苍白的皮肤上，斑驳地挂着赤褐色的血迹，湿漉漉的头发像脏器的残片般无力地垂荡。\n那是一张死人的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没有人能在经历过一场那样的爆炸之后活下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么做到的？你、你是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你初次见到我的时候，我也是受了伤，徒步穿越盐漠来到了雅隆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你那时问我的，是我需不需要帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那时的你，多么渴望自己能帮到他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i06_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可现在呢？当你一次又一次地阻止教士们来救我，当你肆无忌惮地在内心想象我的死亡......你是在谋求什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也被欲望所腐化了，是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有再说任何一句话，西尔弗瘫倒下去。他似乎想抓住什么，却只是把抽屉拽了出来。\n花瓣从抽屉中倾泻而下，埋住了西尔弗的半个身子。\n干枯的花，腐败的花，化作黑灰的花。几年前的花，十几年前的花，几十年前的花。\n长久以来，镇民们为表感谢，向他们的证裁官阁下送上的每一朵花，都在此刻倾泻而下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......花？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你安全了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你母亲发了疯，但我们已经控制住她了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，他在吃什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不！不要！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有罪......让我死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，孩子。你只是想活下去，我不该审判你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的罪，该由你自己活着赎清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有罪的人千千万万。我们行走大地，就是为了帮那些无力自己赎罪的人，为了祛除他们的罪孽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以这样做，这样才能赎清你自己的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终有一日，最纯洁的花朵......也会因你的触摸而绽放。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
